OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 107-year-old WW2
OL,4,Aveteran who has died
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to World War
OL,7,FTwo veteran Norman Irwin, from
OL,8,FColeraine, who has died at the age of
OL,9,F107.
OL,11,FThe death of Norman Irwin was announced
OL,12,Fby his family on Thursday.
OL,14,FNorman Irwin, who was born in 1918 and
OL,15,Fwas understood to be Northern Ireland's
OL,16,Foldest living person before his
OL,17,Fpassing, served in eight countries
OL,18,Fduring WW2 and played a vital role in
OL,19,Fprotecting the Suez Canal from German
OL,20,Fattacks.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
