OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 107-year-old WW2
OL,4,Aveteran who has died
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2025, he was awarded a British
OL,7,FEmpire Medal (BEM) for a range of
OL,8,Fvoluntary work in his County
OL,9,FLondonderry hometown, including at a
OL,10,Fcross-community club for retirees.
